# Prebuilt browser companions of server plugins (e.g. ignis-agent-gateway's
# Copilot for Ignis bundle) are committed artifacts, not build outputs: re-include
# them so the production image can serve /<bundledPluginId>.js. Upstream companions
# like headless-sync's are generated during the build stage and stay excluded.
!apps/ignis-server/server/plugins/*/obsidian/dist/
!apps/ignis-server/server/plugins/*/obsidian/dist/**
apps/ignis-server/server/build-info.json
